OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 8 JAN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GAlfred Brendel plays Beethoven's
OL,11,     G4th Piano Concerto in an archive
OL,12,     Grecording from Munich, plus
OL,13,     GElgar's Enigma Variations from
OL,14,     Gthe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,15,     GWales.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod examines Copland's
OL,18,     Gclosest collaborations - and his
OL,19,     Gpolitical controversies.
